          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "barahatsinda, maze umwami waho n'imidugudu yaho babicisha inkota barimbura abari bayirimo bose pe, ntiyasigaza n'umwe muri bo nk'uko yagize i Debira n'umwami waho, nk'uko yagize i Heburoni kandi nk'uko yagize i Libuna n'umwami waho.",
